WEBVTT

00:00:10.307 --> 00:00:11.475
Hey! Just a minute.
嘿！等等

00:00:11.558 --> 00:00:12.559
Oh, wait. Wait!
等等

00:00:15.312 --> 00:00:16.271
Aw, look at...
看看那个...

00:00:16.355 --> 00:00:18.440
I know Derek, the manager.
He'll vouch for me!
我认识这里的经理德瑞
他可以替我作证！

00:00:18.524 --> 00:00:19.525
Come on!
拜托！

00:00:20.025 --> 00:00:21.110
BOSS BEAR: Hey, Mario!
嘿 马里奥！

00:00:22.152 --> 00:00:23.445
How's it going?
你好吗？

00:00:24.029 --> 00:00:25.322
Oh, for crying out loud!
真是的！

00:00:25.906 --> 00:00:27.199
Yeah, let the bears in.
是的 尽管让熊进入吧

00:00:27.408 --> 00:00:28.867
Let the bears in. Fine.
让熊进入吧 好极了

00:00:29.493 --> 00:00:30.911
(PLAYS OFF-KEY NOTE)

00:00:32.538 --> 00:00:34.123
BIG DADDY: There he is!
他在那里！

00:00:34.373 --> 00:00:36.875
I got a surprise for you, my son. (LAUGHS)
我有个惊喜要给你 我的儿子

00:00:38.002 --> 00:00:39.795
-What's that?
-Tell him the plan.
是什么？

00:00:39.878 --> 00:00:40.879
Right.
好的

00:00:41.213 --> 00:00:44.258
We've been told
there's a ship carrying $25 million in gold
我们收到消息
有一艘载着两千五百万黄金的船...

00:00:44.341 --> 00:00:45.884
gonna dock at night right here.
会在夜里停顿在这里

00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:49.221
With the usual guards here and here.
惯常的保安人员会在这里和那里

00:00:49.304 --> 00:00:52.850
But lucky for us,
there's a sewer right under here.
幸运的是 这里底层正好有一个沟渠

00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:55.644
So, the getaway driver meets us here.
负责开车的司机在这里跟我们会合

00:00:55.769 --> 00:00:59.314
And that is gonna be you this time, Johnny.
这次会是你 强尼

00:00:59.481 --> 00:01:01.817
What? You want, you want me to drive?
什么？你要我开车？

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:04.778
Yeah. It's time my boy
had a proper role in the gang, eh?
是的 我儿子是时候在组织里
担任重要一职了吧？

00:01:05.195 --> 00:01:06.447
Hang on, hang on, Dad.
等等 爸爸 帕里一直是我们的司机

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:07.698
Barry's always been our driver.
等等 爸爸 帕里一直是我们的司机

00:01:07.823 --> 00:01:09.950
Barry don't mind. Do you, Barry?
帕里不会在意的 对吗？

00:01:11.285 --> 00:01:13.620
-No. No, that's fine.
-Yeah.
不会 没关系

00:01:13.787 --> 00:01:16.540
So, when exactly is this ship comin' in then?
这艘船到底什么时候抵达？

00:01:16.623 --> 00:01:17.750
We ain't got a date yet.
我们还没有详细的日期

00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:19.168
Probably won't be for a while though, will it?
但应该还有一段时间

00:01:19.251 --> 00:01:20.419
What do you care?
你为何在乎这个？

00:01:20.502 --> 00:01:22.129
It's the last job we ever need to do.
这次过后我们就不用再干了
时机一到我们就行动 知道吗？

00:01:22.212 --> 00:01:24.715
When it comes in, we go. Right?
这次过后我们就不用再干了
时机一到我们就行动 知道吗？

00:01:25.049 --> 00:01:26.050
Great.
好极了

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:27.551
Can't wait.
真是迫不及待

00:01:28.886 --> 00:01:30.721
Um, hi, I saw your ad in the paper.
嗨 我在报纸上看到你刊登的广告

00:01:30.804 --> 00:01:33.599
Yes, I need a nanny,
just for a couple of weeks.
是 我在找保姆 只需几个礼拜

00:01:33.682 --> 00:01:35.434
-You can? Great!
-(PIGLETS CHATTERING)
你可以胜任？好极了！

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:39.813
The kids?
Yes, they're wonderful. Yeah, I have 25.
孩子们？他们都很好
我有二十五个孩子

00:01:40.564 --> 00:01:42.524
No, I'm not joking.
不 我没开玩笑 但他们都很乖...

00:01:42.608 --> 00:01:44.151
Um, but they're really no problem...
不 我没开玩笑 但他们都很乖...

00:01:44.485 --> 00:01:46.153
-(PHONE DISCONNECTS)
-Hello? Hello?
喂？

00:01:46.236 --> 00:01:47.696
Good night, Mommy.
晚安 妈妈

00:01:50.866 --> 00:01:52.743
Hey! How was the big meeting?
嘿！重大的会议进行的如何？

00:01:52.826 --> 00:01:54.078
(GROANS)
嘿！重大的会议进行的如何？

00:01:54.161 --> 00:01:55.662
That bad, really?
有那么糟糕吗？

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:58.791
Oh, I have something
really exciting to tell you...
我有很兴奋的事要告诉你...

00:01:58.874 --> 00:02:00.876
Mmm. You make the best pie, honey.
你做的派最好吃 亲爱的

00:02:01.043 --> 00:02:02.711
Listen, Norman, I know it's short notice,
听我说 诺门
我知道这件事很临时...

00:02:02.795 --> 00:02:04.963
but I could really use some help
with the kids tomorrow
但我明天需要你帮忙照顾孩子们...

00:02:05.047 --> 00:02:08.092
because, well, you are
not going to believe what I did today.
你不会相信我今天做的事

00:02:09.635 --> 00:02:12.096
Norman, are you listening to me?
诺门 你有听见我说的吗？

00:02:12.179 --> 00:02:13.972
(SNORING)

00:02:15.015 --> 00:02:16.100
(SIGHS)

00:02:19.645 --> 00:02:22.439
BUSTER: Rehearsals begin
first thing tomorrow morning,
排练明天一早开始...

00:02:22.523 --> 00:02:26.026
so get some sleep, and dream big dreams!
早点睡 做个美好的梦！

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:27.778
(ECHOES) Dreams, dreams!
美好的梦想！

00:02:27.861 --> 00:02:28.946
Hmm.
美好的梦想！

00:02:32.324 --> 00:02:33.867
(CLATTERING)

00:02:34.535 --> 00:02:35.953
(WHIRRING)

00:02:37.371 --> 00:02:39.456
(DRILL WHIRRING)

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:40.791
(HAMMERING)

00:02:40.874 --> 00:02:42.042
(SAWING)

00:02:49.925 --> 00:02:51.510
(ALARM RINGS)

00:02:52.177 --> 00:02:53.679
(SCATTERED YAWNS)

00:02:53.804 --> 00:02:55.222
ROSITA: (ON RECORDING)
Good morning, everybody.
大家早安

00:02:55.305 --> 00:02:57.474
Now, I want you all dressed before breakfast.
我要你们在吃早餐前都穿好衣服

00:02:57.724 --> 00:02:59.518
(TRAIN WHISTLE BLOWS)

00:03:02.646 --> 00:03:04.022
PIGLETS: Breakfast!
吃早餐了！

00:03:04.148 --> 00:03:05.899
(ALL CHATTERING INDISTINCTLY)

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:10.445
Rosita, have you seen my car keys?
罗西塔 你有看见我的车钥匙吗？

00:03:10.612 --> 00:03:12.489
ROSITA: Don't forget,
your keys are in your coat pocket.
别忘了 钥匙在外套的袋子里

00:03:12.906 --> 00:03:15.075
Oh, I found 'em. Bye, honey.
我找到了 再见 亲爱的

00:03:15.159 --> 00:03:16.285
Bye, Norman.
再见 诺门

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:19.079
Time for school!
是时候上学了！

00:03:21.081 --> 00:03:22.124
Bye, Iggy. Bye, Perry.
再见伊希 再见派瑞

00:03:22.291 --> 00:03:24.877
Bye, Carla. Bye, Gail.
Bye, Rory. Bye, Micky. Bye, Moe.
再见卡拉 再见戈尔 再见罗莉
再见米奇 再见莫尔

00:03:25.002 --> 00:03:26.461
Bye, Nelson. Bye, Hannah. Bye, Tess.
再见诺森 再见汉娜 再见泰思

00:03:26.545 --> 00:03:27.963
Bye, Kelly. Bye, George. Bye, Andy.
再见凯利 再见乔治 再见安迪

00:03:28.046 --> 00:03:29.840
Bye, Freddy. Bye-bye, Caspar.
再见弗雷迪 再见卡斯珀

00:03:36.722 --> 00:03:38.599
BUSTER: This contest is war!
这场比赛会是场战争！

00:03:39.183 --> 00:03:44.271
This stage is the battlefield.
Your song is your weapon.
舞台就是战场 你们的歌曲就是武器

00:03:44.521 --> 00:03:47.316
Now you only get one shot
to blow that audience away,
你们只有一次机会让观众感到赞叹...

00:03:47.399 --> 00:03:50.903
so choose carefully from
the list of songs I've selected for each of you.
所以要谨慎的挑选
我为各位锁定的歌曲名单

00:03:50.986 --> 00:03:53.572
Ah, talked some sense
into that boyfriend of yours?
说服了你那男友？

00:03:53.655 --> 00:03:56.992
Lance is an artist,
but I wouldn't expect you to understand that.
莱恩斯是位艺术家
但我不奢望你会了解

00:03:57.075 --> 00:03:58.619
You're right. I don't understand that at all.
你说对了 我的确不明白那一套

00:03:58.702 --> 00:04:03.665
Now, you'll notice each list also includes
my costume and performance suggestions.
每份名单上也包括了
我为各位提议的服装和表演方式

00:04:03.749 --> 00:04:05.334
Okay? Miss Crawly will show you
克劳利小姐将会带各位到排练区域

00:04:05.417 --> 00:04:06.501
to your rehearsal spaces.
克劳利小姐将会带各位到排练区域

00:04:06.585 --> 00:04:07.920
Now, let's get to work!
大家开工吧！

00:04:08.003 --> 00:04:09.338
Excuse me, Mr. Moon?
不好意思 穆恩先生？

00:04:09.421 --> 00:04:12.257
For some reason, it says here
that I should be playing the piano?
这里说明了我应该弹钢琴？

00:04:12.341 --> 00:04:15.302
Yes, just imagine, big, soulful guy like you
是的 试想看 像你如此大块头
却又诗情画意弹着钢琴的男生

00:04:15.385 --> 00:04:16.720
tenderly playing the keys.
是的 试想看 像你如此大块头
却又诗情画意弹着钢琴的男生

00:04:16.803 --> 00:04:18.138
There'll be goosebumps everywhere!
一定会让大家起鸡皮疙瘩！

00:04:18.222 --> 00:04:19.973
Well, I haven't played piano since I was a kid.
我只有在很小的时候有弹过钢琴

00:04:20.057 --> 00:04:21.308
Miss Crawly! We're gonna need
克劳利小姐！
我们需要安排钢琴弹奏课！

00:04:21.391 --> 00:04:22.434
some piano lessons over here.
克劳利小姐！
我们需要安排钢琴弹奏课！

00:04:22.517 --> 00:04:24.770
Yes, sir! Up the stairs, I'll be right along.
是的 先生！请上楼去 我随后就来

00:04:24.853 --> 00:04:26.104
And, Pete, you're in here.
皮特 你在这里

00:04:26.188 --> 00:04:27.731
You got it, Mr. Moon.
没问题的 穆恩先生

00:04:27.814 --> 00:04:28.899
(INDISTINCT SHOUTING)

00:04:29.066 --> 00:04:30.108
Check your ego, man!
别如此自大！

00:04:30.192 --> 00:04:31.944
Hey, hey, hey, hey, break it up, break it up.
嘿 别闹了

00:04:32.027 --> 00:04:33.946
Oh, yeah? Tell Ricki! He started it!
是吗？说给里奇听吧！是他先开始的

00:04:34.029 --> 00:04:37.616
That's right! Just like
I started this band! My band, Howie!
没错！这乐队也是我先开始的！
这是我的乐队 豪伊！

00:04:37.699 --> 00:04:39.660
Oh, forgive me, your highness!
请你原谅我 皇上陛下！

00:04:39.743 --> 00:04:40.994
-Guys, come on!
-No, no!
不要！

00:04:41.328 --> 00:04:43.247
Hey! Get out! Get out of here!
嘿！给我出去！

00:04:43.455 --> 00:04:44.998
(JAPANESE SONG PLAYING)

00:04:51.046 --> 00:04:54.383
Look, just calm down and pick a song.
你们心平气和地挑选一首歌

00:04:54.591 --> 00:04:56.677
I think we'll probably
have a better chance of winning
我想我们若要获胜...

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:59.680
if I do the singing part
and leave the dancing part to you.
我负责唱歌 跳舞的部分就交给你

00:04:59.763 --> 00:05:01.473
Bah! Are you joking me?
你开什么玩笑？

00:05:01.556 --> 00:05:04.268
You are just in need of,
like, a super cool warm-up.
你不过是需要一个酷毙了的热身

00:05:04.643 --> 00:05:06.770
Come on! Let's take off these clothes!
来吧！脱掉那些衣服！

00:05:06.853 --> 00:05:08.689
-(DISCO MUSIC PLAYING)
-That, that is not necessary.
没有那个必要吧

00:05:09.815 --> 00:05:11.817
Oh! That is a lot of skin.
那太过暴露了

00:05:13.485 --> 00:05:16.780
Ah, don't you look so worried face!
I've got one for you, too!
你别那么担心！
我也为你准备了一套！

00:05:17.614 --> 00:05:20.367
-Hey, porky! Keep it down, will ya!
-GUNTER: Sorry.
嘿！猪猪！小声点行吗？

00:05:20.826 --> 00:05:22.619
Hey, Moon, you gave me the wrong list.
嘿 穆恩 你给错我名单了

00:05:22.786 --> 00:05:24.871
Cheesy pop's not exactly my style.
俗气的流行乐不是我的曲风

00:05:24.955 --> 00:05:27.582
Style! I'm glad you brought that up.
Now, let's see...
我真高兴你提到曲风！我们来看看...

00:05:27.916 --> 00:05:28.917
-There.
-(SHUDDERS)
这样吧

00:05:29.001 --> 00:05:30.752
Isn't this a great color for you?
这颜色好极了 对吗？

00:05:30.836 --> 00:05:34.298
I can't tell. It's melting my eyes.
You got anything in black?
我看不出来 因为我快被那颜色
弄瞎了 有任何黑色的服装吗？

00:05:34.381 --> 00:05:37.092
Black? What, you want
everyone to think you're going to a funeral?
黑色？你想要大家以为
你是来参加丧礼吗？

00:05:37.175 --> 00:05:39.720
You think you're some kind of
artsy-fartsy type? No, no, no.
你以为自己属于那些
搞怪的艺术家？才不是

00:05:39.803 --> 00:05:42.264
Bingo! Pop star princess!
搞定！流行乐公主！

00:05:42.347 --> 00:05:43.557
(SCATTERED GASPS)

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:44.808
ROSITA: Wait, what happened?
慢着 发生什么事了？

00:05:45.058 --> 00:05:46.351
Is this part of the competition?
这也是比赛的环节之一吗？

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:48.854
Okay, everybody, don't panic. Don't panic.
好的 各位无需惊慌

00:05:48.937 --> 00:05:50.397
-MIKE: What's going on?
-Talk to me, Crawly.
-发生什么事？
-说给我听 克劳利小姐

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:53.817
When did we last pay
the power company, Mr. Moon?
我们上次交电费是什么时候
穆恩先生？

00:05:54.026 --> 00:05:55.360
Oh, for Pete's sake.
该死的

00:05:55.944 --> 00:05:57.279
Okay, don't worry, everybody.
好的 各位别担心

00:05:57.446 --> 00:05:58.655
I will take care of this.
我来处理

00:05:58.739 --> 00:06:01.325
In the meantime,
you will continue to rehearse in the dark.
你们继续在黑暗中排练！

00:06:01.575 --> 00:06:03.493
-What?
-But I can't see anything.
我什么也看不见

00:06:03.577 --> 00:06:06.079
Don't you worry, Rosita. I have glow sticks.
别担心 罗西塔 我有荧光棒

00:06:06.788 --> 00:06:08.206
Great! Use this time
好极了！你们乘机摆脱第一天的尴尬
我去去就回

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:11.043
to shake off those first day inhibitions,
and I'll be right back.
好极了！你们乘机摆脱第一天的尴尬
我去去就回

00:06:11.418 --> 00:06:12.461
MIKE: You got to be kidding me.
开什么玩笑

00:06:12.544 --> 00:06:14.629
Okay, you heard him. Back to work now!
好了 各位听到了 回去工作！

00:06:14.713 --> 00:06:16.340
Come on, everybody.
来吧 各位

